        "priority": "high",
        "content": "## Root cause\n\nWidgets loses a saved layout when the window is resized during a save \u2014 the save reads the size twice.\n\n## Impact\n\nA person's layout is silently replaced by the default one, and they must rebuild it by hand.\n\n- Severity: medium\n- Workaround: avoid resizing while the save indicator shows\n- Severity with the workaround: low\n- Priority estimate: high (severity with the workaround low; fires intermittently; 1 occurrence; not raised)\n\n## Examples\n\nResizing the window while saving a layout named `caf\u00e9` restores the default layout.\n\n## Suggested fix\n\nRead the window size once per save.\n\n**Contributing locations.**\n\n- github.com/example/widgets `src/layout.rs`: reads the size twice\n\n## Owning runs\n\n- nightly-2026-11-01\n\n## Evidence\n\nThe run's log shows two size reads 40 ms apart during one save.",
